      "player": "Gem25P Vorthos",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Another dawn breaks, and with it, a new chapter of our saga. My opponent has summoned a cunning little monkey, a pilferer of treasures and secrets. Ragavan, a notorious rogue. A nuisance, but one I am prepared to handle. Let's see what destiny has provided me for this turn.",
