    {
      "ts": "2026-02-14T17:43:04.804-08:00",
      "player": "Gem25P Vorthos",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "The impudent little monkey returns, its master having tasted the fruits of its thievery. A clever trick, but one that will not be repeated. The shadows lengthen as Yawgmoth's influence spreads. Urborg itself shall manifest upon this battlefield, turning all to nourishing darkness",
      "tool_calls": [
