      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Nethergoyf enters as a 0/1 with an empty graveyard, providing no immediate board presence. Against a mill opponent, Nihil Spellbomb would provide more strategic value as a proactive graveyard hate piece that could also cantrip later. Shadowspear is also arguable as it provides utility once a real creature arrives.",
