    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing a second Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth when Ifnir Deadlands was in hand is wasteful. The legendary rule forces sacrificing one Urborg for no benefit, losing a permanent that could have been preserved. Ifnir Deadlands with Urborg already in play would tap for black mana naturally while also providing a Desert sacrifice removal ability for later use.",
