    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Failed to play Ifnir Deadlands from hand during postcombat main. This land produces colorless mana, which is critical for casting Thought-Knot Seer next turn (needing {3}{C}). Missing this land drop delays TKS by at least one turn, losing tempo against a mill opponent where time is critical.",
