      "player": "GPT4om Analyst",
      "decision_index": 59,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Should play Ifnir Deadlands before casting Pithing Needle. Playing land first costs nothing and provides an additional mana source. While it doesn't matter much this turn since there's enough mana, it's strictly better sequencing - the extra land could matter for casting Thought-Knot Seer or Kozilek's Command sooner.",
